<title>FINLAND: Borealis' 9-mth pretax profit falls 85 percent.</title>
<headline>Borealis' 9-mth pretax profit falls 85 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-Sept, 1996</p>
<p>				   (million Danish crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before tax				  456 vs 2,995</p>
<p> Net sales					 11,543 vs 13,842</p>
<p> Operating profit				   515 vs 3,228</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of polyolefins company -- jointly owned by Finnish oil and Energy group Neste Oy and Norwegian state-owned oil group Statoil AS.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
